desc.text:
The <color=#ffd780>Detection Core</color> created by the Elemental Skill <color=#ffd780>Principle: Variable Detection</color> is enhanced. Depending on the state of the <color=#ffd780>Detection Core</color> created:
·Steady State: All nearby party members gain 30 Elemental Mastery for each <color=#ffd780>Gradient Beacon</color> Mitya has;
·Overloaded: After nearby party members trigger Stellar-Conduct reactions, instead obtain 1 <color=#ffd780>Gradient Beacon</color> every 1.5s for 6s.
